designer_notes = "BOLT'S DAMAGE BENCHED (armor run P1, 2026-11-15, Luke's B14; PLACEHOLDER for his feel check): 12 a hit every 0.6 s, about 20 a second, in line with the bow's full draws (30 per ~1.36 s, ~22 a second, arrows paid) and under the sword's string (~21-28) and the axe's (~23); was 9 (~15). THE STAFF (owner, 2026-10-20): a spell's damage, cooldown (its own: no global cooldown) and range. How it lands is its SpellDef (content/spell/)."
